berg", "summary": "Col de Berg is an indoor riding game built for gravel. The rider pedals a smart trainer, and the game draws real tracks, trails and climbs built from map and land-survey data. Every unsealed sector is timed and rated, and the surface under the wheel sets the trainer's resistance: compacted gravel rolls half as hard again as tarmac, loose gravel more than twice as hard. Other modes include free ride around a city and trail running. The game works with the Indoor Bike companion app, which holds the trainer from a phone or tablet.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/col-de-berg", "videos": [{"id": 204121, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "uucsEg9xCGU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uucsEg9xCGU", "title": "The same gravel ride in six kinds of day \u2013 Col de Berg, the indoor gravel game", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uucsEg9xCGU/qhddefault.jpg"}]}